@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Digidoclocker)

[*] --> Registration

state Registration
Registration : entry / Get the Registration Details

state Login
Login : entry / Check Login Credentials

state DocumentUpload
DocumentUpload : entry / Upload Documents

state ProfileView
ProfileView : entry / View Profile

state CertificateApply
CertificateApply : entry / Apply for Certificates

state RegistrarRequest
RegistrarRequest : entry / Request Certificates

state SessionEnd
SessionEnd : entry / End Session

Registration --> Login : [Proceed to Login]
Login --> DocumentUpload : [Logged In and Ready to Upload Documents]
Login --> ProfileView : [Logged In and Ready to View Profile]
ProfileView --> CertificateApply : [Ready to Apply for Certificates]
CertificateApply --> DocumentUpload : [Need to Upload More Documents]
DocumentUpload --> CertificateApply : [Continue Applying for Certificates]
RegistrarRequest --> Login : [Logged In as Registrar to Request Certificates]
Login --> RegistrarRequest : [Logged In and Ready to Request Certificates]
CertificateApply --> SessionEnd : [Done with Actions]
RegistrarRequest --> SessionEnd : [Done with Actions]

@enduml
